 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Estimated reading time: 5 minutes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;

&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;Your First Look at Millersville
 &lt;div id="your-first-look-at-millersville" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#your-first-look-at-millersville" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Millersville is what Anne Arundel County does best when it comes to family living—suburban neighborhoods with top-rated schools, parks that actually get used, and a pace that lets childhood happen at a normal speed. The community has grown steadily over the years, and it shows in the infrastructure: wide streets, well-maintained parks, and a population that feels established but still growing.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>AACPS Enrollment Guide</title><link>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/enrollment-guide/</link><pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/enrollment-guide/</guid><description>&lt;h1 class="relative group"&gt;AACPS Enrollment Guide
