 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Public schools are assigned by address.&lt;/strong&gt; Your specific street address determines which elementary, middle, and high school your child attends.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Military Education &amp; Training Opportunities</title><link>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/military-education/</link><pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/military-education/</guid><description>&lt;h1 class="relative group"&gt;Military Education &amp;amp; Training Opportunities
